/FMc {
 FMcmyk length FMcmyk maxlength ge { /FMcmyk FMcmyk dup length dup add dict copy def } if
 4 array astore 4 1 roll 8 bitshift add 8 bitshift add exch FMcmyk 3 1 roll put
}FmBD
